WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:03.136
-Hey, guys, it is Friday,
and that's usually when

00:00:03.136 --> 00:00:04.203
I take care of some business.

00:00:04.203 --> 00:00:05.471
You know,
I get some things done.

00:00:05.471 --> 00:00:07.139
But the day just
completely got away from me.

00:00:07.139 --> 00:00:08.708
I spent all day watching
YouTube videos of

00:00:08.708 --> 00:00:12.612
people eating ghost peppers.

00:00:12.612 --> 00:00:15.447
And I completely forgot to write
out my weekly thank-you notes.

00:00:15.447 --> 00:00:17.750
And I know it's during the show,
but do you guys mind if

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:18.918
I write out some
thank-you notes right now?

00:00:18.918 --> 00:00:20.386
Is that okay?
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:20.386 --> 00:00:22.254
Appreciate it.

00:00:22.254 --> 00:00:25.457
James, can you help me out
when you can?

00:00:25.457 --> 00:00:26.726
[ Soft music playing ]

00:00:26.726 --> 00:00:29.328
Thank you,
Joe Biden and Kamala Harris,

00:00:29.328 --> 00:00:31.931
for making us all feel like
mom and dad just got home

00:00:31.931 --> 00:00:36.969
after having
the worst babysitter ever.

00:00:36.969 --> 00:00:39.739
"You wouldn't believe
what happened."

00:00:41.674 --> 00:00:42.975
[ Soft music playing ]

00:00:42.975 --> 00:00:47.713
Thank you, Hot Pockets recalling
760,000 pounds of product

00:00:47.713 --> 00:00:50.683
due to broken glass in it,
for being the first time

00:00:50.683 --> 00:00:54.054
anyone has ever
cared what's in a Hot Pocket.

00:00:56.856 --> 00:01:00.659
Sausage Meat Lover -- Whatever.
Just microwave it.

00:01:00.659 --> 00:01:02.895
It tastes good.

00:01:02.895 --> 00:01:04.229
[ Soft music playing ]

00:01:04.229 --> 00:01:07.733
Thank you, playoff game between
Tampa Bay and Green Bay.

00:01:07.733 --> 00:01:10.303
Regardless of who wins,
at least I can still say...

00:01:18.844 --> 00:01:20.146
Oh, yeah.
[ Soft music playing ]

00:01:20.146 --> 00:01:23.849
Thank you, vending machines
with COVID home tests,

00:01:23.849 --> 00:01:25.851
for being the only time
a vending-machine purchase

00:01:25.851 --> 00:01:29.122
has positively affected
my health.

00:01:29.122 --> 00:01:30.857
Mm...

00:01:34.861 --> 00:01:38.030
We did another one about
the COVID vending machines.

00:01:38.030 --> 00:01:41.300
This was a good --
It was a good subject.

00:01:41.300 --> 00:01:42.668
No, I mean
I'm about to write it,

00:01:42.668 --> 00:01:43.670
my thank-you note, again, yeah.

00:01:43.670 --> 00:01:44.938
-Oh, okay. Just came to you.

00:01:44.938 --> 00:01:48.474
-Same address.
-Yeah.

00:01:48.474 --> 00:01:49.775
[ Soft music playing ]

00:01:49.775 --> 00:01:52.745
-Thank you, vending machines
with COVID home tests,

00:01:52.745 --> 00:01:54.614
for explaining why
I just saw someone

00:01:54.614 --> 00:01:57.417
trying to stick
a Twix bar up their nose.

00:01:59.418 --> 00:02:02.489
Come on. Come on.

00:02:04.890 --> 00:02:07.093
Do I have tissues here?
I do.

00:02:10.563 --> 00:02:12.799
Ah-ah-choo!

00:02:14.567 --> 00:02:15.768
[ Laughs ]

00:02:15.768 --> 00:02:18.404
[ Breathes deeply, sneezes ]

00:02:18.404 --> 00:02:22.208
[ Breathes deeply, sneezes ]

00:02:22.208 --> 00:02:23.609
Whew!

00:02:23.609 --> 00:02:25.278
It always comes in fours.

00:02:25.278 --> 00:02:28.047
[ Breathes deeply, sneezes ]

00:02:28.047 --> 00:02:32.217
[ Laughter ]

00:02:32.217 --> 00:02:33.986
-What the heck is your problem?

00:02:33.986 --> 00:02:36.388
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah.

00:02:36.388 --> 00:02:39.525
-My jeans came with no pockets.

00:02:39.525 --> 00:02:43.028
[ Breathes deeply, sneezes ]

00:02:43.028 --> 00:02:46.332
[ Laughs ]

00:02:46.332 --> 00:02:49.368
-What is going on?

00:02:49.368 --> 00:02:51.837
-[ Laughing ] Here we go.

00:02:51.837 --> 00:02:53.439
Alright.

00:02:55.040 --> 00:02:56.342
[ Soft music playing ]

00:02:56.342 --> 00:02:59.345
Thank you, transition lenses,
for letting me feel like

00:02:59.345 --> 00:03:01.380
I have a superpower
where I transform into

00:03:01.380 --> 00:03:03.650
a European deejay.

00:03:11.456 --> 00:03:12.791
[ Soft music playing ]

00:03:12.791 --> 00:03:16.462
Thank you, Dr. Scholl's
foot machines at drugstores,

00:03:16.462 --> 00:03:18.464
for being the
"Dance Dance Revolution"

00:03:18.464 --> 00:03:21.000
for 60-year-olds with bunions.

00:03:22.801 --> 00:03:27.573
[ Beat-boxing ]
♪♪

00:03:27.573 --> 00:03:28.708
[ Soft music playing ]

00:03:28.708 --> 00:03:31.777
Thank you, avocado pits,
for showing me how

00:03:31.777 --> 00:03:33.146
Skee-Balls are born.

00:03:33.146 --> 00:03:36.082
There you go, everybody.
Those are our "Thank You Notes."

